# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Calibration images are not tracked, deliberately.
#
# A .nib file holds the contents of one device of one specific instrument.
# Loading another instrument's calibration image produces a machine that
# satisfies its own checksum and reads incorrectly, which is the failure this
# project exists to prevent. Backups belong somewhere private and off the
# machine that made them.
#
# The pattern below is broad on purpose: every .bin this tool produces is a
# calibration image, and a missed one is worse than an over-broad rule.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
*.bin

# Internal status notes
HANDOVER.md

# Build and packaging artefacts
__pycache__/
*.pyc
build/
2724A_NOVRAM_Project.zip

# Development test harness, kept locally but not distributed
test_protocol.py